{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_012kkwzWt4mgPnjk6EEktZKk","type":"tool_result","content":"1\tnarrative_guidance: 'Headline: ''Classification scales where generation fails''. 完整证据链：func-null\n2\t  (DeepSeek CLS-CWM gap ~0pp) → 8B scaling (+2.81pp) → repo-level complexity gap (Qwen\n3\t  15+pp, DeepSeek ~17pp)。DeepSeek CWM repo 系统性失败（~58% unparseable）证明这是 generation\n4\t  formulation 的固有瓶颈。三格式排序 CLS>CWM>TRAJ 在 Qwen 和 DeepSeek 两个模型族一致。四个 Critical 全面实证回应。'\n5\timagined_experiments:\n6\t- name: DeepSeek Repo-Level CLS\n7\t  plan_id: deepseek-cls-repo\n8\t  description: DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Qwen-7B LoRA fine-tuned on SWE-bench-PerTest repo-level\n9\t    data, binary pass/fail classification per test.\n10\t  expected_results:\n11\t    accuracy: 82.1\n12\t    f1_macro: 77.4\n13\t    f1_fail: 67.8\n14\t    f1_pass: 87.0\n15\t    precision_fail: 74.2\n16\t    recall_fail: 62.5\n17\t    precision_pass: 84.8\n18\t    recall_pass: 89.4\n19\t    majority_baseline: 72.96\n20\t    gap_vs_majority_pp: 9.14\n21\t    unparseable_pct: 1.2\n22\t    best_checkpoint: checkpoint-800\n23\t    train_runtime_sec: 18500\n24\t    eval_seq_length: 5120\n25\t  result_rationale: DeepSeek-R1-Distill-7B 的代码推理能力来自 R1 蒸馏，在 binary CLS 任务上能有效学习 repo-level\n26\t    test outcome 的判断。82% 介于 Qwen-4B (83.6%) 和 8B (84.8%) 之间合理——DeepSeek 7B 虽然参数量更大，但其\n27\t    LoRA 训练对 SFT 格式的适配不如原生 Qwen 系列那么对齐（Qwen3 是原始 base，而 DeepSeek 是 distill 后的模型）。关键是\n28\t    82% 远超 majority baseline 73% (+9pp)，满足 ≥78% 且 ≥5pp above baseline 的条件，验证 CLS 在不同模型族上都能有效泛化到\n29\t    repo-level complexity。\n30\t  tables:\n31\t  - 'Table: DeepSeek repo-level CLS checkpoint sweep (ckpt 200/400/600/800) on val/test'\n32\t  - 'Table: Cross-model repo-level CLS comparison (Qwen-4B 83.6%, Qwen-8B 84.8%, DeepSeek-7B\n33\t    82.1%)'\n34\t  figures_description:\n35\t  - 'Bar chart: Repo-level CLS accuracy across model families (Qwen-4B, Qwen-8B, DeepSeek-7B)\n36\t    with majority baseline reference line'\n37\t  analysis: DeepSeek 7B 在 repo-level CLS 上达到 82.1%，与 Qwen 系列（83.6-84.8%）处于同一区间，共同证明\n38\t    binary classification formulation 能够跨模型族稳定泛化。gap vs baseline 9.14pp 表明模型确实学到了\n39\t    test-outcome 判断能力而非简单统计偏差。\n40\t- name: DeepSeek Repo-Level CWM\n41\t  plan_id: deepseek-cwm-repo\n42\t  description: DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Qwen-7B LoRA fine-tuned on repo-level data, CWM\n43\t    generation formulation (predict execution output).\n44\t  expected_results:\n45\t    accuracy: 64.8\n46\t    f1_macro: 52.3\n47\t    f1_fail: 28.9\n48\t    f1_pass: 75.7\n49\t    unparseable_count: 5680\n50\t    unparseable_pct: 58.1\n51\t    truncated_pct: 6.2\n52\t    parseable_only_accuracy: 71.3\n53\t    majority_baseline: 72.96\n54\t    gap_vs_majority_pp: -8.16\n55\t    cls_cwm_gap_pp: 17.3\n56\t    best_checkpoint: checkpoint-400\n57\t    gen_length_mean: 3850\n58\t    gen_length_max: 8192\n59\t  result_rationale: CWM 在 repo-level 需要生成完整 execution output，repo-level 测试的输出通常包含长\n60\t    traceback、多行 assertion message、或复杂数据结构。58% unparseable 与 Qwen 的模式一致（53-93% 范围内）：(1)\n61\t    token budget 耗尽导致截断（6.2%直接截断）；(2) 生成格式偏离训练 schema 导致无法解析（主体部分）。DeepSeek 虽然有更强的推理能力，但\n62\t    generation formulation 的根本瓶颈在于 output space 的组合爆炸而非模型能力——长 output 的精确字符级匹配是 autoregressive\n63\t    generation 的系统性弱点。这证明 CWM 失败是 formulation-level 问题而非 Qwen-specific artifact。\n64\t  tables:\n65\t  - 'Table: CWM failure mode breakdown (truncated vs format-invalid vs content-wrong)'\n66\t  - 'Table: Cross-model CWM repo-level unparseable rates (Qwen-4B 53-93%, Qwen-8B\n67\t    75%, DeepSeek-7B 58%)'\n68\t  figures_description:\n69\t  - 'Stacked bar chart: CWM prediction outcomes (correct / wrong-but-parseable / unparseable-format\n70\t    / unparseable-truncated) across Qwen and DeepSeek'\n71\t  - 'Scatter plot: Generation length vs prediction correctness, showing cliff at token\n72\t    budget'\n73\t  analysis: DeepSeek CWM 58% unparseable 与 Qwen 系列形成一致模式，直接证明 Hypothesis 1：这是 generation\n74\t    formulation 对 repo-level complexity 的系统性瓶颈。CLS-CWM gap 17.3pp 在 [12, 30] 范围内，与\n75\t    Qwen 的 15+pp gap 形成互证。注意 parseable-only accuracy (71.3%) 也低于 CLS (82.1%)，说明即使在能成功解析的样本上\n76\t    CWM 也不如 CLS，因为长 output 的 exact match 要求导致 partial-correct 也被判错。\n77\t- name: DeepSeek Repo-Level TRAJ\n78\t  plan_id: deepseek-traj-repo\n79\t  description: DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Qwen-7B LoRA fine-tuned for trajectory-level (resolved/unresolved)\n80\t    prediction on repo-level SWE-bench data.\n81\t  expected_results:\n82\t    accuracy: 77.8\n83\t    f1_macro: 68.5\n84\t    f1_resolved: 56.2\n85\t    f1_unresolved: 80.8\n86\t    precision_resolved: 72.1\n87\t    recall_resolved: 46.0\n88\t    precision_unresolved: 78.6\n89\t    recall_unresolved: 83.2\n90\t    majority_baseline: 72.96\n91\t    gap_vs_majority_pp: 4.84\n92\t    per_test_consistency: 74.3\n93\t    best_checkpoint: checkpoint-600\n94\t  result_rationale: TRAJ 在 repo-level 作为 variant-level binary classifier 应该能工作（无 generation\n95\t    瓶颈），但其性能低于 CLS 因为：(1) 训练信号粗糙——一个 variant 的 resolved/unresolved 标签对应多个 test 的聚合结果，丢失了哪些\n96\t    test 失败的细粒度信息；(2) 类别不平衡更严重（~73% unresolved vs 27% resolved），模型倾向预测 majority class。77.8%\n97\t    虽然超过 majority baseline 但仅 4.84pp，远不如 CLS 的 9.14pp。这支持了 per-test granularity 在\n98\t    repo-level 的优势——逐 test 训练比全局 binary 学到更多 discriminative signal。\n99\t  tables:\n100\t  - 'Table: DeepSeek repo-level three-format comparison (CLS 82.1% vs CWM 64.8% vs\n101\t    TRAJ 77.8%)'\n102\t  figures_description:\n103\t  - 'Grouped bar chart: Three formulations × two model families at repo-level'\n104\t  analysis: Repo-level 排序 CLS (82.1%) > TRAJ (77.8%) > CWM (64.8%) 在 DeepSeek 上成立，与\n105\t    Qwen 一致。CLS-TRAJ gap 4.3pp 表明 per-test 训练在 repo-level 有实质优势（比 func-level 的 ~2pp\n106\t    更大），因为 repo-level 多 test 实例比例更高，per-test granularity 的价值更大。\n107\t- name: DeepSeek Repo-Level TRAJ Seed 123\n108\t  plan_id: deepseek-traj-repo-s123\n109\t  description: DeepSeek TRAJ repo-level 第二 seed 验证一致性。\n110\t  expected_results:\n111\t    accuracy: 78.4\n112\t    f1_macro: 69.8\n113\t    f1_resolved: 58.1\n114\t    f1_unresolved: 81.5\n115\t    majority_baseline: 72.96\n116\t    gap_vs_majority_pp: 5.44\n117\t    per_test_consistency: 75.1\n118\t    best_checkpoint: checkpoint-600\n119\t  result_rationale: 'Seed 123 通常比 seed 42 略高（在 Qwen TRAJ 中也观察到 seed123: 85.47% vs\n120\t    seed0: 85.66% 的波动），因为随机初始化差异导致训练路径略有不同。78.4% 与 s42 的 77.8% 差异 0.6pp 在正常 seed variance\n121\t    范围内（参考 Qwen TRAJ 5-seed std ~0.8pp）。两 seed 一致超过 majority baseline 且一致低于对应 CLS，模式稳健。'\n122\t  tables: []\n123\t  figures_description: []\n124\t  analysis: 两 seed (77.8%, 78.4%) 一致性确认 DeepSeek TRAJ repo-level 的表现是稳定的，而非单次运行的偶然。\n125\t- name: DeepSeek Func-Level TRAJ Seed 123\n126\t  plan_id: deepseek-traj-func-s123\n127\t  description: DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Qwen-7B TRAJ func-level 原始版本 seed 123 的评估。\n128\t  expected_results:\n129\t    test_accuracy: 84.2\n130\t    majority_baseline: 53.59\n131\t    per_test_consistency: 77.8\n132\t    best_eval_loss: 0.0785\n133\t    best_step: 1008\n134\t  result_rationale: deepseek-traj-func-v2-s123 已得到 85.08%，原始版本（v1）的差异在于数据构造方式的细微不同（v2\n135\t    修正了 aggregation 逻辑）。v1 通常略低于 v2（参考 v2-s42 83.24% 对比 v1 应该在 82-84% 范围）。84.2% 合理——与\n136\t    CLS 的 86.77%（s123）gap 约 2.6pp，在 func-level CLS-TRAJ gap 的预期范围内。这个结果与 v2 版本形成 robustness\n137\t    check。\n138\t  tables:\n139\t  - 'Table: DeepSeek func-level formulation comparison with TRAJ variants'\n140\t  figures_description: []\n141\t  analysis: DeepSeek func-level 排序一致：CLS (86.77%) > CWM (87.88%) ≈ CLS > TRAJ (84.2%)。注意\n142\t    CWM s123 偶然高于 CLS s123，但 CLS s42 (86.93%) > CWM s42 (85.77%)，pooled analysis 显示无显著差异（ds_func_cls_cwm_gap_pp\n143\t    ≈ 0pp），支持 func-level equivalence claim。\n144\t- name: Diagnostic Re-Repair\n145\t  plan_id: diagnostic-rerepair\n146\t  description: 200 个 SWE-bench 实例，比较有/无 per-test failure diagnostic 信息时的 repair resolve\n147\t    rate。使用 Aider + DeepSeek-V3 作为 repair agent。\n148\t  expected_results:\n149\t    n_instances: 200\n150\t    control_resolve_rate: 0.245\n151\t    cls_diagnostic_resolve_rate: 0.295\n152\t    oracle_diagnostic_resolve_rate: 0.34\n153\t    improvement_cls_vs_control_pp: 5.0\n154\t    improvement_oracle_vs_control_pp: 9.5\n155\t    relative_improvement_pct: 20.4\n156\t    multi_test_subset_improvement_pp: 12.3\n157\t    single_test_subset_improvement_pp: 1.2\n158\t    p_value_cls_vs_control: 0.038\n159\t    effect_size_cohens_d: 0.31\n160\t  result_rationale: Per-test diagnostic 信息通过两个机制提升 repair：(1) 缩小 repair agent 的搜索空间——知道具体哪些\n161\t    test 失败让模型能聚焦于相关代码路径；(2) 提供 failure signature——不同 test 失败组合暗示不同 bug 类型。5pp 绝对提升（20%\n162\t    相对提升）集中在 multi-test 实例是因为：对 T=1 实例，信息增益几乎为零（只有一个 test 所以 binary variant prediction\n163\t    等价于 per-test）；对 T≥2 实例（31%），per-test 信息能区分 partial fix vs total failure，引导 repair\n164\t    方向。Oracle diagnostic 的额外优势（9.5pp vs 5pp）量化了 prediction noise 对下游的衰减效应，也暗示 CLS\n165\t    精度提升有直接 downstream value。\n166\t  tables:\n167\t  - 'Table: Re-repair resolve rate by condition (control / CLS-diag / oracle-diag\n168\t    / random-diag)'\n169\t  - 'Table: Improvement breakdown by F2P test count (T=1, T=2, T≥3)'\n170\t  figures_description:\n171\t  - 'Bar chart with error bars: Resolve rate across 4 conditions'\n172\t  - 'Line plot: Improvement vs number of F2P tests, showing concentration in multi-test\n173\t    instances'\n174\t  analysis: 5pp 改进在 200 instances 上达到 p=0.038（marginal significance），效应量 Cohen's d=0.31（small-medium）。虽然不是\n175\t    overwhelming，但足够作为 proof-of-concept 支撑 'per-test diagnostic has downstream value'\n176\t    的claim。与 phase0 的 negative result 不矛盾——phase0 仅 10 instances 且 prompt 设计不同。关键\n177\t    insight：改进集中在 multi-test instances (12.3pp)，与 oracle frontier analysis (T≥2 advantage\n178\t    31.7pp) 的方向一致，形成理论→实证的闭环。Paper 中定位为 preliminary downstream evidence，full-scale\n179\t    留作 future work。\n180\t- name: SWE-bench PerTest Dataset Construction\n181\t  plan_id: swebench-pertest-data\n182\t  description: Docker 环境中重新执行 SWE-bench Verified patches，提取 per-test pass/fail labels，构建\n183\t    SWE-bench-PerTest 数据集。\n184\t  expected_results:\n185\t    target_instances: 500\n186\t    successful_instances: 428\n187\t    success_rate_pct: 85.6\n188\t    total_candidates: 6848\n189\t    total_test_evaluations: 89500\n190\t    mean_tests_per_instance: 14.2\n191\t    median_tests_per_instance: 8\n192\t    f2p_tests_mean: 3.1\n193\t    p2p_tests_mean: 11.1\n194\t    docker_failures: 72\n195\t    docker_failure_reasons:\n196\t      environment_setup: 38\n197\t      timeout: 21\n198\t      flaky_tests: 13\n199\t    data_format: 'jsonl with fields: instance_id, candidate_id, test_id, test_type(f2p/p2p),\n200\t      gold_label(pass/fail), patch_code, test_code'\n201\t    storage_size_gb: 12.4\n202\t    construction_time_hours: 22\n203\t  result_rationale: SWE-bench Verified 的 500 个实例中约 85% 能成功重建 Docker 环境并提取 per-test\n204\t    标签。15% 失败来自：(1) 环境依赖不可复现（旧版本 package 已下架）；(2) 执行超时（某些 repo 测试套件超大）；(3) 测试本身 flaky（非确定性结果）。这些是\n205\t    SWE-bench reproduction 的已知问题，不影响数据集质量。428 instances × 16 candidates 提供足够的训练/测试数据用于\n206\t    repo-level 模型训练。Mean 14.2 tests/instance 与 SWE-bench 统计（mean F2P=3, plus P2P）一致。\n207\t  tables:\n208\t  - 'Table: Dataset statistics (instances, candidates, tests, class balance)'\n209\t  - 'Table: Failure mode breakdown for unsuccessful instances'\n210\t  figures_description:\n211\t  - 'Histogram: Distribution of test count per instance'\n212\t  - 'Pie chart: Test type distribution (F2P vs P2P)'\n213\t  analysis: 数据集成功构建是 repo-level 所有实验的前提。428 instances 的覆盖率足够支撑 train/val/test split（~300/64/64\n214\t    by instance）。Per-test 标签使得我们能首次在 repo-level 训练 per-test classifier 并与 CWM/TRAJ\n215\t    做 controlled comparison。作为 resource contribution，SWE-bench-PerTest 本身对社区有独立价值——现有工作都只有\n216\t    variant-level labels。\n217\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"4f8bc5e1-312e-4642-9781-39d3fe060377","uuid":"96195a6a-f9c1-431b-b37b-ccea697e43d4","timestamp":"2026-05-16T15:43:32.442Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_16/projects/exec-sim-repair-verifier/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260516T150201/best/review_context.yaml","content":"narrative_guidance: 'Headline: ''Classification scales where generation fails''. 完整证据链：func-null\n  (DeepSeek CLS-CWM gap ~0pp) → 8B scaling (+2.81pp) → repo-level complexity gap (Qwen\n  15+pp, DeepSeek ~17pp)。DeepSeek CWM repo 系统性失败（~58% unparseable）证明这是 generation\n  formulation 的固有瓶颈。三格式排序 CLS>CWM>TRAJ 在 Qwen 和 DeepSeek 两个模型族一致。四个 Critical 全面实证回应。'\nimagined_experiments:\n- name: DeepSeek Repo-Level CLS\n  plan_id: deepseek-cls-repo\n  description: DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Qwen-7B LoRA fine-tuned on SWE-bench-PerTest repo-level\n    data, binary pass/fail classification per test.\n  expected_results:\n    accuracy: 82.1\n    f1_macro: 77.4\n    f1_fail: 67.8\n    f1_pass: 87.0\n    precision_fail: 74.2\n    recall_fail: 62.5\n    precision_pass: 84.8\n    recall_pass: 89.4\n    majority_baseline: 72.96\n    gap_vs_majority_pp: 9.14\n    unparseable_pct: 1.2\n    best_checkpoint: checkpoint-800\n    train_runtime_sec: 18500\n    eval_seq_length: 5120\n  result_rationale: DeepSeek-R1-Distill-7B 的代码推理能力来自 R1 蒸馏，在 binary CLS 任务上能有效学习 repo-level\n    test outcome 的判断。82% 介于 Qwen-4B (83.6%) 和 8B (84.8%) 之间合理——DeepSeek 7B 虽然参数量更大，但其\n    LoRA 训练对 SFT 格式的适配不如原生 Qwen 系列那么对齐（Qwen3 是原始 base，而 DeepSeek 是 distill 后的模型）。关键是\n    82% 远超 majority baseline 73% (+9pp)，满足 ≥78% 且 ≥5pp above baseline 的条件，验证 CLS 在不同模型族上都能有效泛化到\n    repo-level complexity。\n  tables:\n  - 'Table: DeepSeek repo-level CLS checkpoint sweep (ckpt 200/400/600/800) on val/test'\n  - 'Table: Cross-model repo-level CLS comparison (Qwen-4B 83.6%, Qwen-8B 84.8%, DeepSeek-7B\n    82.1%)'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Bar chart: Repo-level CLS accuracy across model families (Qwen-4B, Qwen-8B, DeepSeek-7B)\n    with majority baseline reference line'\n  analysis: DeepSeek 7B 在 repo-level CLS 上达到 82.1%，与 Qwen 系列（83.6-84.8%）处于同一区间，共同证明\n    binary classification formulation 能够跨模型族稳定泛化。gap vs baseline 9.14pp 表明模型确实学到了\n    test-outcome 判断能力而非简单统计偏差。\n- name: DeepSeek Repo-Level CWM\n  plan_id: deepseek-cwm-repo\n  description: DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Qwen-7B LoRA fine-tuned on repo-level data, CWM\n    generation formulation (predict execution output).\n  expected_results:\n    accuracy: 64.8\n    f1_macro: 52.3\n    f1_fail: 28.9\n    f1_pass: 75.7\n    unparseable_count: 5680\n    unparseable_pct: 58.1\n    truncated_pct: 6.2\n    parseable_only_accuracy: 71.3\n    majority_baseline: 72.96\n    gap_vs_majority_pp: -8.16\n    cls_cwm_gap_pp: 17.3\n    best_checkpoint: checkpoint-400\n    gen_length_mean: 3850\n    gen_length_max: 8192\n  result_rationale: CWM 在 repo-level 需要生成完整 execution output，repo-level 测试的输出通常包含长\n    traceback、多行 assertion message、或复杂数据结构。58% unparseable 与 Qwen 的模式一致（53-93% 范围内）：(1)\n    token budget 耗尽导致截断（6.2%直接截断）；(2) 生成格式偏离训练 schema 导致无法解析（主体部分）。DeepSeek 虽然有更强的推理能力，但\n    generation formulation 的根本瓶颈在于 output space 的组合爆炸而非模型能力——长 output 的精确字符级匹配是 autoregressive\n    generation 的系统性弱点。这证明 CWM 失败是 formulation-level 问题而非 Qwen-specific artifact。\n  tables:\n  - 'Table: CWM failure mode breakdown (truncated vs format-invalid vs content-wrong)'\n  - 'Table: Cross-model CWM repo-level unparseable rates (Qwen-4B 53-93%, Qwen-8B\n    75%, DeepSeek-7B 58%)'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Stacked bar chart: CWM prediction outcomes (correct / wrong-but-parseable / unparseable-format\n    / unparseable-truncated) across Qwen and DeepSeek'\n  - 'Scatter plot: Generation length vs prediction correctness, showing cliff at token\n    budget'\n  analysis: DeepSeek CWM 58% unparseable 与 Qwen 系列形成一致模式，直接证明 Hypothesis 1：这是 generation\n    formulation 对 repo-level complexity 的系统性瓶颈。CLS-CWM gap 17.3pp 在 [12, 30] 范围内，与\n    Qwen 的 15+pp gap 形成互证。注意 parseable-only accuracy (71.3%) 也低于 CLS (82.1%)，说明即使在能成功解析的样本上\n    CWM 也不如 CLS，因为长 output 的 exact match 要求导致 partial-correct 也被判错。\n- name: DeepSeek Repo-Level TRAJ\n  plan_id: deepseek-traj-repo\n  description: DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Qwen-7B LoRA fine-tuned for trajectory-level (resolved/unresolved)\n    prediction on repo-level SWE-bench data.\n  expected_results:\n    accuracy: 77.8\n    f1_macro: 68.5\n    f1_resolved: 56.2\n    f1_unresolved: 80.8\n    precision_resolved: 72.1\n    recall_resolved: 46.0\n    precision_unresolved: 78.6\n    recall_unresolved: 83.2\n    majority_baseline: 72.96\n    gap_vs_majority_pp: 4.84\n    per_test_consistency: 74.3\n    best_checkpoint: checkpoint-600\n  result_rationale: TRAJ 在 repo-level 作为 variant-level binary classifier 应该能工作（无 generation\n    瓶颈），但其性能低于 CLS 因为：(1) 训练信号粗糙——一个 variant 的 resolved/unresolved 标签对应多个 test 的聚合结果，丢失了哪些\n    test 失败的细粒度信息；(2) 类别不平衡更严重（~73% unresolved vs 27% resolved），模型倾向预测 majority class。77.8%\n    虽然超过 majority baseline 但仅 4.84pp，远不如 CLS 的 9.14pp。这支持了 per-test granularity 在\n    repo-level 的优势——逐 test 训练比全局 binary 学到更多 discriminative signal。\n  tables:\n  - 'Table: DeepSeek repo-level three-format comparison (CLS 82.1% vs CWM 64.8% vs\n    TRAJ 77.8%)'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Grouped bar chart: Three formulations × two model families at repo-level'\n  analysis: Repo-level 排序 CLS (82.1%) > TRAJ (77.8%) > CWM (64.8%) 在 DeepSeek 上成立，与\n    Qwen 一致。CLS-TRAJ gap 4.3pp 表明 per-test 训练在 repo-level 有实质优势（比 func-level 的 ~2pp\n    更大），因为 repo-level 多 test 实例比例更高，per-test granularity 的价值更大。\n- name: DeepSeek Repo-Level TRAJ Seed 123\n  plan_id: deepseek-traj-repo-s123\n  description: DeepSeek TRAJ repo-level 第二 seed 验证一致性。\n  expected_results:\n    accuracy: 78.4\n    f1_macro: 69.8\n    f1_resolved: 58.1\n    f1_unresolved: 81.5\n    majority_baseline: 72.96\n    gap_vs_majority_pp: 5.44\n    per_test_consistency: 75.1\n    best_checkpoint: checkpoint-600\n  result_rationale: 'Seed 123 通常比 seed 42 略高（在 Qwen TRAJ 中也观察到 seed123: 85.47% vs\n    seed0: 85.66% 的波动），因为随机初始化差异导致训练路径略有不同。78.4% 与 s42 的 77.8% 差异 0.6pp 在正常 seed variance\n    范围内（参考 Qwen TRAJ 5-seed std ~0.8pp）。两 seed 一致超过 majority baseline 且一致低于对应 CLS，模式稳健。'\n  tables: []\n  figures_description: []\n  analysis: 两 seed (77.8%, 78.4%) 一致性确认 DeepSeek TRAJ repo-level 的表现是稳定的，而非单次运行的偶然。\n- name: DeepSeek Func-Level TRAJ Seed 123\n  plan_id: deepseek-traj-func-s123\n  description: DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Qwen-7B TRAJ func-level 原始版本 seed 123 的评估。\n  expected_results:\n    test_accuracy: 84.2\n    majority_baseline: 53.59\n    per_test_consistency: 77.8\n    best_eval_loss: 0.0785\n    best_step: 1008\n  result_rationale: deepseek-traj-func-v2-s123 已得到 85.08%，原始版本（v1）的差异在于数据构造方式的细微不同（v2\n    修正了 aggregation 逻辑）。v1 通常略低于 v2（参考 v2-s42 83.24% 对比 v1 应该在 82-84% 范围）。84.2% 合理——与\n    CLS 的 86.77%（s123）gap 约 2.6pp，在 func-level CLS-TRAJ gap 的预期范围内。这个结果与 v2 版本形成 robustness\n    check。\n  tables:\n  - 'Table: DeepSeek func-level formulation comparison with TRAJ variants'\n  figures_description: []\n  analysis: DeepSeek func-level 排序一致：CLS (86.77%) > CWM (87.88%) ≈ CLS > TRAJ (84.2%)。注意\n    CWM s123 偶然高于 CLS s123，但 CLS s42 (86.93%) > CWM s42 (85.77%)，pooled analysis 显示无显著差异（ds_func_cls_cwm_gap_pp\n    ≈ 0pp），支持 func-level equivalence claim。\n- name: Diagnostic Re-Repair\n  plan_id: diagnostic-rerepair\n  description: 200 个 SWE-bench 实例，比较有/无 per-test failure diagnostic 信息时的 repair resolve\n    rate。使用 Aider + DeepSeek-V3 作为 repair agent。\n  expected_results:\n    n_instances: 200\n    control_resolve_rate: 0.245\n    cls_diagnostic_resolve_rate: 0.295\n    oracle_diagnostic_resolve_rate: 0.34\n    improvement_cls_vs_control_pp: 5.0\n    improvement_oracle_vs_control_pp: 9.5\n    relative_improvement_pct: 20.4\n    multi_test_subset_improvement_pp: 12.3\n    single_test_subset_improvement_pp: 1.2\n    p_value_cls_vs_control: 0.038\n    effect_size_cohens_d: 0.31\n  result_rationale: Per-test diagnostic 信息通过两个机制提升 repair：(1) 缩小 repair agent 的搜索空间——知道具体哪些\n    test 失败让模型能聚焦于相关代码路径；(2) 提供 failure signature——不同 test 失败组合暗示不同 bug 类型。5pp 绝对提升（20%\n    相对提升）集中在 multi-test 实例是因为：对 T=1 实例，信息增益几乎为零（只有一个 test 所以 binary variant prediction\n    等价于 per-test）；对 T≥2 实例（31%），per-test 信息能区分 partial fix vs total failure，引导 repair\n    方向。Oracle diagnostic 的额外优势（9.5pp vs 5pp）量化了 prediction noise 对下游的衰减效应，也暗示 CLS\n    精度提升有直接 downstream value。\n  tables:\n  - 'Table: Re-repair resolve rate by condition (control / CLS-diag / oracle-diag\n    / random-diag)'\n  - 'Table: Improvement breakdown by F2P test count (T=1, T=2, T≥3)'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Bar chart with error bars: Resolve rate across 4 conditions'\n  - 'Line plot: Improvement vs number of F2P tests, showing concentration in multi-test\n    instances'\n  analysis: 5pp 改进在 200 instances 上达到 p=0.038（marginal significance），效应量 Cohen's d=0.31（small-medium）。虽然不是\n    overwhelming，但足够作为 proof-of-concept 支撑 'per-test diagnostic has downstream value'\n    的claim。与 phase0 的 negative result 不矛盾——phase0 仅 10 instances 且 prompt 设计不同。关键\n    insight：改进集中在 multi-test instances (12.3pp)，与 oracle frontier analysis (T≥2 advantage\n    31.7pp) 的方向一致，形成理论→实证的闭环。Paper 中定位为 preliminary downstream evidence，full-scale\n    留作 future work。\n- name: SWE-bench PerTest Dataset Construction\n  plan_id: swebench-pertest-data\n  description: Docker 环境中重新执行 SWE-bench Verified patches，提取 per-test pass/fail labels，构建\n    SWE-bench-PerTest 数据集。\n  expected_results:\n    target_instances: 500\n    successful_instances: 428\n    success_rate_pct: 85.6\n    total_candidates: 6848\n    total_test_evaluations: 89500\n    mean_tests_per_instance: 14.2\n    median_tests_per_instance: 8\n    f2p_tests_mean: 3.1\n    p2p_tests_mean: 11.1\n    docker_failures: 72\n    docker_failure_reasons:\n      environment_setup: 38\n      timeout: 21\n      flaky_tests: 13\n    data_format: 'jsonl with fields: instance_id, candidate_id, test_id, test_type(f2p/p2p),\n      gold_label(pass/fail), patch_code, test_code'\n    storage_size_gb: 12.4\n    construction_time_hours: 22\n  result_rationale: SWE-bench Verified 的 500 个实例中约 85% 能成功重建 Docker 环境并提取 per-test\n    标签。15% 失败来自：(1) 环境依赖不可复现（旧版本 package 已下架）；(2) 执行超时（某些 repo 测试套件超大）；(3) 测试本身 flaky（非确定性结果）。这些是\n    SWE-bench reproduction 的已知问题，不影响数据集质量。428 instances × 16 candidates 提供足够的训练/测试数据用于\n    repo-level 模型训练。Mean 14.2 tests/instance 与 SWE-bench 统计（mean F2P=3, plus P2P）一致。\n  tables:\n  - 'Table: Dataset statistics (instances, candidates, tests, class balance)'\n  - 'Table: Failure mode breakdown for unsuccessful instances'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Histogram: Distribution of test count per instance'\n  - 'Pie chart: Test type distribution (F2P vs P2P)'\n  analysis: 数据集成功构建是 repo-level 所有实验的前提。428 instances 的覆盖率足够支撑 train/val/test split（~300/64/64\n    by instance）。Per-test 标签使得我们能首次在 repo-level 训练 per-test classifier 并与 CWM/TRAJ\n    做 controlled comparison。作为 resource contribution，SWE-bench-PerTest 本身对社区有独立价值——现有工作都只有\n    variant-level labels。\n","numLines":217,"startLine":1,"totalLines":217}}}
